<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>backstage-gen-cli</id>
    <version>0.1.0-alpha1</version>
    <title>backstage-gen-cli</title>
    <authors>gautampachnanda101</authors>
    <owners>gautampachnanda101</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/gautampachnanda101/backstage-gen-cli</projectUrl>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/gautampachnanda101/backstage-gen-cli/blob/main/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/gautampachnanda101/backstage-gen-cli</projectSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/gautampachnanda101/backstage-gen-cli/tree/main/docs</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/gautampachnanda101/backstage-gen-cli/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>backstage catalog yaml cli devops</tags>
    <summary>CLI tool for generating and validating Backstage catalog-info.yaml files</summary>
    <description>
backstage-gen-cli is a Go-based CLI tool for streamlining Backstage catalog integration.

Features:
- Auto-detection of technology stack (20+ languages supported)
- Cross-platform support (Windows, macOS, Linux)
- AI-powered suggestions via LLM integration
- Interactive wizard for guided catalog generation
- YAML generation with proper formatting
- Validation against Backstage schema
- Pre-commit hook integration
- Fast and portable single binary

Commands:
- inspect: Analyze repository and detect technology stack
- generate: Generate catalog-info.yaml file
- lint: Validate catalog files
- hooks: Manage git hooks
- init: Initialize with LLM support
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/gautampachnanda101/backstage-gen-cli/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
    <file src="legal\**" target="legal" />
  </files>
</package>
